 "equipment_type": "Multi-sensor room sensor hub",
 "applies_to": "Delta Controls O3 ceiling sensor hubs (firmware 2.0 and later; some objects need newer firmware).",
 "summary": "The O3 is a ceiling-mounted room sensor hub that reports temperature, humidity, occupancy (motion plus sound), light level and color, and sound level as BACnet objects. It also has a light ring, speaker, IR blaster and two universal I/O points. Most objects are readings; the AVs set sensitivities, timers and the light ring or sound behaviour.",
 "bacnet_transport": [
  "BACnet IP"
 ],
 "firmware": "2.0 or later (objects note their own minimum version)",
 "default_device_instance": null,
 "access_inferred": true,
 "notes": [
  "The article has no read/write column: access is inferred from object type and the descriptions.",
  "Temperature and light units follow the unit objects (AIC1 Celsius / AIC2 Fahrenheit, AIC3 Lux / AIC4 Footcandles), so no unit is shown for those values.",
  "Delta-specific objects are left out: AIC1-AIC7, MIC1-MIC3, the Network Port objects NP10 (Bluetooth) and NP13 (MQTT), and the proprietary SUA, OS, ORS and BDE objects.",
  "Only one object can exist per universal I/O point: xP1 / xP2 are created as AI, BI, AO or BO, not all four.",
  "Legacy objects left out: BV 31 and BV 48 (replaced by NP10 / NP13 in 4.16), CSV 41 (unused since 2.0), BV 42 (removed in 2.4) and the objects the article lists as removed.",
  "The objects article does not name the transport; Delta's O3 provisioning and FAQ articles say it speaks BACnet/Ethernet (the default) or BACnet IP, plus BACnet/SC, and not BACnet MS/TP.",
  "Newer objects: AV 40 needs 2.4, AV 251-253 need 2.3, AV 41 needs 2.6, AV 52 needs 4.18."
 ],
 "source": {
  "title": "BACnet Objects in the O3 (Delta Controls O3 support article)",
  "doc_number": "4427505298963",
